[0.062, "o", "backend  : pf\r\navailable: true\r\nphase    : LOCKED\r\nmanaged  : true\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "detail   :\r\n  No ALTQ support in kernel\r\n  ALTQ related functions disabled\r\n  pass quick on lo0 all flags S/SA keep state\r\n  pass quick inet6 proto ipv6-icmp all icmp6-type neighbrsol no state\r\n  pass quick inet6 proto ipv6-icmp all icmp6-type neighbradv no state\r\n  pass quick inet6 proto ipv6-icmp all icmp6-type routersol no state\r\n  pass quick inet6 proto ipv6-icmp all icmp6-type routeradv no state\r\n  pass out quick inet proto udp from any port = 68 to any port = 67 no state\r\n  pass in quick inet proto udp from any port = 67 to any port = 68 no state\r\n  block drop out quick all\r\n  block drop in quick all\r\n"]
